    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia makumi abidi ne tshitanu tshia buhika buetu, ku tshibangidilu tshia tshidimu, mu dituku dia dikumi dia ngondo, tshiakadi tshidimu tshia dikumi ne tshinai tshia ku nyima kua tshidimu tshiakashihabo musoko, mu dituku adi mene tshianza tshia Yehowa tshiakadi hamʼbidi hanyi, ne yeye wakalua nʼanyi kuinaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bikena kumona bia Nzambi yeye wakalua nʼanyi mu buloba bua Isalele, wakanshikika ha mutu ha mukuna mule mule, kuakadi nsubu muidikishe hanshi bu musoko ku luseke lua sude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakalua nʼanyi mu muaba au, ekumona! Muntu wakadiku wakadi ne tshinfuanyi bu tshia tshiamu tshia mitaku, muikale ne muonshi wa lin mu tshianza tshiandi, ne luidi lua kuidikisha nʼalu; wakimana biandi mu tshibuelelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu eu wakangambila ne, Muana wa muntu, mona ne mesu ebe, unvua ne matshu ebe, teka mutshima webe ku malu andualua kukulesha; bualu bua bakulua nʼebe kunoko bua meme kukulesha malu â; ambila Bena Isalele malu onso audi umona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakamona lumbu lunyunguluke nsubu nseke yonso. Muntu au wakaluidikisha ne luidi luakadi mu tshianza tshiandi, bule bualu buikale coudées",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40.5:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Coudêe ntshihiminu tshia Bena Yuda, bule bua 52 cm. mu Yehezekele.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mile isambombo, coudée umue muikale bu coudée umue ne ntanta wa tshianza;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40.5:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ntanta wa tshianza wakadi tshituha tshisambombo tshia",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "coudée",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "umue mu Yehezekele.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wakidikisha mulumbu wa lumbu, wakausangana muikale luidi lumue, ne bule bualu bua mulu buakadi luidi lumue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakalua nʼanyi ku tshibuelelu tshidi tshitangila ku luseke lua esete; hakabandeye ku tshibandilu tshiatshi, wakidikisha mushiku watshi wa mbelu, wakaumona muikale luidi lumue mu butshiama buau; mushiku wa mbelu mukuabo mutangilangane ne tshitendelelu wakadi luidi lumue mu butshiama buau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsubu yonso ya bansentedi yakadi ne bule bua luidi lumue ne butshiama bua luidi lumue, ne muaba wa hankatshi ha nsubu ne nsubu wakadi coudées",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40.7:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tangila 40.5.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " itanu; ne tshibuelelu tshia ku mbalanda wa ku tshibi tshiakatangilangana ne tshitendelelu tshiakadi bule bua luidi lumue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40.8:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Minga mikanda ya kale yakadi ne mei â:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Wakidikisha mbalanda wa tshibuelelu mutangilangane ne tshitendelelu, wakadi luidi lumue",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakidikisha mbalanda wa ku tshibuelelu, ne wakadi coudées muanda mukulu mu butshiama buandi, ne biluwa biandi biakadi coudées ibidi mu butshiama bua tshiluwa ne tshiluwa; ne mbalanda wa tshibuelelu wakatangilangana ne tshitendelelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsubu ya bansentedi ya munda mua tshibuelelu tshia ku luseke lua esete yakadi isatu ku luseke lua tshinga tshianza ne isatu ku luseke lua tshianza tshikuabo; buonso buai yakadi bunene bumue; biluwa bia ku luseke ne ku luseke biakadi bunene bumue kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakidikisha butshiama bua mushiku wa mbelu wa ku tshibuelelu etshi, wakadi coudées dikumi; ne butshiama bua nshila wa munda mua tshibuelelu buakadi coudées dikumi ne isatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mpala kua nsubu ne nsubu ya bansentedi kuakadi tshididi tshiakajika munda mua tshibuelelu ku luseke ne ku luseke coudée umue, ne nsubu yonso ya bansentedi yakadi coudées isambombo ku luseke ne ku luseke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakidikisha butshiama bua tshibuelelu ku nfundu kua nsubu umue wa bansentedi tô ne ku nfundu kua nsubu mukuabo wa bansentedi, buakadi coudées makumi abidi ne itanu, ku tshibi tô ne ku tshinga tshibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakidikisha bule bua mbalanda, buakadi coudées makumi abidi mu muaba muakadi tshiendelu tshia munda mua ntempelo tshituangana ne mbalanda eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, ku mushiku wa mbelu wa ku mpala kua tshibuelelu tô ne ku mushiku wa mbelu wakadi ku mpala kua mbalanda eu kuakadi coudées makumi atanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madidishi mikale ne tubaya tutshiamakashe akadi mu bimanu bia nsubu ya bansentedi, mu miaba ya hankatshi ha nsubu ei, ne mu bimanu bia mbalanda, mu nseke yonso ya munda mua tshibuelelu, ne ha tshiluwa ne tshiluwa tshia tshibuelelu hakadi bifuanyikishi bia mabue a ngashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe wakalua neanyi mu tshiendelu tshia ntempelo tshia mu luhanza, ne nakamona nsubu mitangilangane ne nshila mulongolola ne mabue hanshi munyunguluke tshiendelu; nsubu makumi asatu yakadiku ne mpala yai mitangile ku nshila eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshila eu wakayila hehi ne bibuelelu, ne butshiama buandi buakadi muomumue ne bule bua bibuelelu; nshila eu wakadi wa mu tshibanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nyima wakidikisha butshiama bua tshiendelu tshia hankatshi ha mushiku wa tshibuelelu tshia mu tshibanda tô ne ku mushiku wa tshibuelelu tshiakayila ku tshiendelu tshia munda, buakadi coudées lukama ku luseke lua esete ne ku luseke lua nôde muomumue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakalua nʼanyi ku tshibuelelu tshia mu tshiendelu tshia mu lubanza tshiakatangila ku luseke lua nôde, wakidikisha bule buatshi ne butshiama buatshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshiakadi ne nsubu isatu ya bansentedi ku luseke elu ne nsubu isatu ku luseke lukuabo, biluwa biatshi ne mbalanda watshi biakadi ne bunene buobumue ne bua bia tshibuelelu tshia kumudilu. Bule buatshi buakadi coudées makumi atanu ne butshiama buatshi buakadi coudées makumi abidi ne itanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madidishi atshi, mbalanda watshi, mabue atshi a ngashi, biakadi ne luidi luolumue ne lua tshibuelelu tshia ku luseke lua esete. Bakabanda ku tshibandilu tshiakadi ne bidiatshilu muanda mutekete; ne mbalanda watshi wakatangilangana ne munda mua ntempelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshiendelu tshia munda mua ntempelo tshiakadi ne tshibuelelu tshitangilangane ne tshibuelelu tshia mu lubanza, tshikuabo ku luseke lua nôde ne tshikuabo ku luseke lua esete; wakidikisha muaba wa hankatshi ha tshibuelelu tshia munda tô ne ku tshibuelelu tshia mu luhanza, wakadi coudées",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
