            "sid": "EZK 40:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsubu mukuabo wakadiku ne mushiku wandi wa mbelu mutangilangane ne mbalanda wa tshibuelelu etshi, ne bakuvuwamu milambu ya kuosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha mbalanda wa tshibuelelu etshi hakadi mesa abidi ku luseke elu ne mesa abidi ku luseke lukuabo, bua kushihelahu mulambu wa kuosha, mulambu wa kubuikidila nʼau mibi ne mulambu wa kumusha dihila dia bubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku luseke lukuabo lua mu lubanza lua mbalanda, luayila muntu habandeye ku mbelu kua tshibuelelu tshia ku luseke lua nôde, kuakadi mesa abidi ku luseke elu ne mesa abidi ku luseke lukuabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu kuamba ne, Mesa anai munda mua tshibuelelu, ne mesa anai mu luhanza luatshi, mesa muanda mukulu mene akadibo bashihelahu milambu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesa anai akasongabo ku mabue akadiku, mesa ne mesa mikale ne bule bua coudée umue ne tshituha, ne butshiama bua coudée umue ne tshituha, ne bule bua mulu coudée umue, kuakatekelabo tuele ne biamu bia kushiha nʼabi milambu ya kuosha ne milambu mikuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akadi ne mibangu bule bua ntanta wa tshianza mikuate ku nseke yau yonso inai; ne bakateka minyinyi ya milambu ha mesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
