          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakalua nʼanyi mu tshiendelu tshia munda mua ntempelo, ne nakamona nsubu ibidi mu tshiendelu tshia munda, mukuabo ku luseke lua tshibuelelu tshia ku luseke lua node, mushiku wandi wa mbelu mutangilangane ne luseke lua sude; mukuabo ku luseke lua tshibuelelu tshia ku luseke lua sude, mushiku wandi wa mbelu mutangilangane ne luseke lua nôde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakangambila ne, Nsubu eu udi mutangile ku luseke lua sude udi wa bakuidi badi balami ba nsubu wa tshitendelelu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne nsubu eu mukuabo udi mutangile ku luseke lua nôde udi wa bakuidi badi bakuata mudimu wa tshioshelu; aba mbana balume ba Sadoka, ne anu bobo nkayabo ba munkatshi mua bana ba Lewi badi mua kulua hehi ne Yehowa bua kumukuatshila mudimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakidikisha tshiendelu tshia munda, bule buatshi coudées lukama, butshiama buatshi coudées lukama, nseke yatshi yonso yakadi luidi lumue; ne tshioshelu tshia milambu tshiakadi ku mpala kua nsubu wa tshitendelelu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
