        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe wakalua nʼanyi ku mbalanda wa nsubu wa tshitendelelu, wakidikisha biluwa bia mbalanda, biakadi ne butshiama bua coudées itanu ku luseke ne ku luseke. Butshiama bua mushiku wa mbelu buakadi coudées dikumi ne inai, ne tshibi tshia ku luseke ne ku luseke lua mushiku tshiakadi coudées isatu mu butshiama buatshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
